          {
            "index": 3476,
            "source_segment_index": 3476,
            "start_ms": 6663390,
            "end_ms": 6666270,
            "text": "机械守卫守护11号机械守卫"
          },
          {
            "index": 3477,
            "source_segment_index": 3477,
            "start_ms": 6666270,
            "end_ms": 6669090,
            "text": "通灵师验证了11号机械狼为守卫身份"
          },
          {
            "index": 3478,
            "source_segment_index": 3478,
            "start_ms": 6669090,
            "end_ms": 6672360,
            "text": "当夜为4号守卫单死在第二天的白天"
